name: Taint candidate discovery is experimental and missing model selection starts no analysis
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_candidate.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 READY THE MAP RUN | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: use taint-iris-next
submit: run .
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 Choose an exact tool | explicit-choice
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_candidate.py @TMP_TARGET @ART before
paste-file: @ART/command.txt
keys: Enter
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 requires an explicit model | missing-model
expect-not: Investigation allowance refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_candidate.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · blocked | blocked-receipt
expect-not: Investigation allowance refused
ask: Is this clearly discovery work, with an honest model-selection failure and no Review or Scan completion claimed?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: failure-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: failure-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: failure-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: failure-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · blocked | failure-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: failure-detail-40x12
ask: Are failed outcome, the selected-action name and model recovery readable through paging at each size without hidden work or a fallback?
resize: 120x36
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 READY THE MAP RUN | restart-setup
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · blocked | recovered
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/taint_candidate.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restart
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the failure and fresh Setup without another request, a substituted model or new phase progress?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | restart-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
